Just wanted to say Thanks to the tournament runners.   You all put
quite a lot of work into it, and it was a lot of fun to be involved.
Although I have to say it's quite a grind.  I normally don't have this
kind of time to play, but some late nights and snow days helped out.

I saw a lot of suggestions, some good and bad, but I like it as it is.
It'd be nice to see the runners-up.  I.e, earning 8 conducts doesn't
win that award but it's quite an accomplishment.

I don't play for score so I only went for the recognitions.  And
there's no way I'm getting 13 in a row.  I was aiming for the Hat Trick
and finished just now.  Actually I thought I was done, checked the
scoreboard and realized I forgot dwarves.  5 ascentions in 14 games is
an improvement for me.  My normal "no-wish no-genocide" rule was
shelved, and of course this makes a big difference.  From ~12% to 35%
is a big change.  That's counting the grue death.  I bet everybody had
one of those. 

Thanks again.

